{"articleNo":"476916","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=476916&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [대플특화] 대구대학교 반도체 직무아카데미(취업연계 1차) 신청","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2024.03.18","hit":"2709","attachments":[{"name":"[대구대_대플특화]2024학년도 반도체직무아카데미(1차) 참가자 모집 안내.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=476916&attachNo=132621"},{"name":"반도체 직무아카데미 프로그램 안내(리플릿).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=476916&attachNo=132622"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoQZkhFeA3AtgRwJ4GkDuWAqAdgBYDWAJgCICGaA8tQLIB0AVgA4DmQA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">프로그램명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">반도체 직무아카데미</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(1</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">차</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">취업연계프로그램</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">교육 개요</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">교육방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">대면 및 비대면 혼합 진행</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">모집인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: 30</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">명 내외</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">   </span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\"> </span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">3) </span></u><u><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">신청대상</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">: </span></u><u><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">지역청년</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">(</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">타 대학생</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">, </span></u><u><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">전문대학 재학생 및 졸업생</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">)</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">4) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">교육기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: 2024. 3. 18.(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) ~ 4. 8.(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">학생모집 상황 및 기업의 채용일정에 따라 교육기간은 일부 변동될 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">5) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">교육장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">온라인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(ZOOM) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">강의 및 대구대학교 진로취업관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">층 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">NCS</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">강의실</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">교육장소는 진행상황에 따라 변경될 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">신청 안내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">신청 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: ~2024.3.15.(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">신청 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">붙임 참조</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">): </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-f